# Testing Standards — ZyraVision

## Framework de Testes
- Backend: Pest PHP (NAO PHPUnit puro)
- Frontend: Vitest para unit tests
- E2E: Playwright

## Piramide de Testes
- 75% Unit Tests
- 20% Integration/Feature Tests
- 5% E2E Tests

## Cobertura Minima
- Backend: 80%
- Frontend: 70%
- Criticos (auth, billing, storage): 90%

## Backend (Pest PHP)

```php
// Feature Test
it('lista cameras do tenant autenticado', function () {
    $user = User::factory()->create();
    Camera::factory()->count(3)->for($user->tenant)->create();

    actingAs($user)
        ->getJson('/api/v1/cameras')
        ->assertOk()
        ->assertJsonCount(3, 'data');
});

// Unit Test
it('calcula storage usado pelo tenant', function () {
    $service = new StorageService();
    $usage = $service->calculateUsage($tenant);

    expect($usage)->toBeGreaterThan(0);
});
```

## Frontend (Vitest)

```typescript
import { mount } from '@vue/test-utils'
import ZyButton from '@/Components/UI/ZyButton.vue'

test('renderiza botao primary', () => {
  const wrapper = mount(ZyButton, {
    props: { variant: 'primary' },
    slots: { default: 'Salvar' }
  })
  expect(wrapper.text()).toBe('Salvar')
  expect(wrapper.classes()).toContain('bg-primary-600')
})
```

## Convencoes
- Descrever em portugues o que o teste faz
- Um assert por conceito
- Factories para dados de teste
- Database transactions em feature tests
- Mock servicos externos (FFmpeg, S3)
